'''Hearts''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing the [[2026 Valentine's Box]] for 30 [[Heart Gems]] [[File:Heart Gem.png|25x25px]] or 60 [[Diamonds|Gems]] [[File:Diamond_icon.png|25x25px]] during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Day Event]].

== Appearance ==
The blade is a light red to light pink gradient with hearts on it, hence the name. The guard is light red and the handle is solid black.
